      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但话说回来……所谓比赛、\n本就是缘分交织的舞台。\n只要继续奔跑、总会再度相遇的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "114696e9190704fe4c4dfc4042942f31b168befed8373658a5bf1349f11cba7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
